{"actor":"server","event":"response","topic_id":"2024-145979","model_call":1,"request":{"op":"query","query":"(^ \"vicarious trauma\" (+ coping cope manage self-care resilience) (+ definition symptoms))"},"record":{"query":{"op":"query","query":"(^ \"vicarious trauma\" (+ coping cope manage self-care resilience) (+ definition symptoms))"},"response":{"burrow":"/data/ssd3/claclark/msm-2.1.burrow","docno":"msmarco_v2.1_doc_13_1647729865#0_3617397938","ok":true,"op":"query","qid":"q1006","rank":1,"snippet":"and Ways to Help Vicarious Trauma: When Empathy Goes Too Far & How to Cope with it Vicarious Trauma: When Empathy Goes Too Far & How to Cope with it Uncategorized Vicarious Trauma Trauma can affect not only the person directly experiencing it, but also the person helping them cope with their distressing experiences. The more empathetic and open you are in your profession, the more likely it is that you will share the pain and devastation of those impacted by trauma. Often, people who help behind the scenes in helping those with trauma might neglect their own exposure. In this article, you will learn what Vicarious Trauma is, some of the <cover>symptoms associated with it. You will also learn how to cope with Vicarious Trauma </cover>so that you can live a happy and balanced professional life. What is Vicarious Trauma & Who is Susceptible to it? Vicarious Trauma refers to the trauma you may experience when being indirectly exposed to a traumatic event.\" , \"start_char\": 0.000000 , \"title\": \"Vicarious Trauma: What Causes it and Ways to Help\" , \"url\": \"https://cbtpsychology.com/vicarioustrauma/\" }"},"time":241},"model_calls":1,"document_judgments":0,"relevance_3":0,"max_document_judgments":50,"max_model_calls":100}
