{"actor":"server","event":"response","topic_id":"2024-145979","model_call":10,"request":{"op":"query","query":"(^ \"vicarious trauma\" \"what is vicarious trauma\" (+ cope coping \"self-care\" manage strategies))"},"record":{"query":{"op":"query","query":"(^ \"vicarious trauma\" \"what is vicarious trauma\" (+ cope coping \"self-care\" manage strategies))"},"response":{"burrow":"/data/ssd3/claclark/msm-2.1.burrow","docno":"msmarco_v2.1_doc_13_1647729865#0_3617397938","ok":true,"op":"query","qid":"q1010","rank":1,"snippet":"{ \"docid\": \"msmarco_v2.1_doc_13_1647729865#0_3617397938\" , \"end_char\": 983.000000 , \"headings\": \"Vicarious Trauma: When Empathy Goes Too Far & How to Cope with it Vicarious Trauma: When Empathy Goes Too Far & How to <cover>Cope with it What is Vicarious Trauma & </cover>Who is Susceptible to it? Signs and Symptoms of Vicarious Trauma How to Treat Vicarious Trauma Methods To Treat Vicarious Trauma Trauma-Focused Cognitive Behavioural Therapy (TF-CBT): Eye Movement Desensitization and Reprocessing (EMDR): Get Professional Help \" , \"segment\": \"Vicarious Trauma: What Causes it and Ways to Help Vicarious Trauma: When Empathy Goes Too Far & How to Cope with it Vicarious Trauma: When Empathy Goes Too Far & How to Cope with it Uncategorized Vicarious Trauma Trauma can affect not only the person directly experiencing it, but also the person helping them cope with their distressing experiences. The more empathetic and open you are in your profession, the more likely it is that you will share the pain and devastation of those impacted by trauma. Often, people who help behind the scenes in helping those with trauma ","skipped":[{"docno":"msmarco_v2.1_doc_13_1647729865#0_3617397938","rank":1,"relevance":3}]},"time":48},"model_calls":10,"document_judgments":9,"relevance_3":5,"max_document_judgments":50,"max_model_calls":100}
